### Create a new realm
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/realms/create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Realm10",
  "slug": "test-realm10"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("realmId", response.body.id)
%}

### Create new tenant is last created realm
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/tenants/create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "realmId": "{{realmId}}",
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Test Tenant 3",
  "slug": "test-tenant-3"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tenantId", response.body.id)
%}

### Create new account in tenant
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/accounts/create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "c84bbba6-a0b0-4a35-a9f9-ceb941112a14",
  "enabled": true,
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "firstName": "testy",
  "lastName": "testerson",
  "phone": "+17015550101",
  "username": "testy-testerson",
  "attributes": {
    "test": 2
  }
}


### Search for a tenant
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/tenants/search
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "realmId": "152ab2d6-a4aa-4053-a3a6-546ebdf083f6",
  "cursor": null,
  "limit": 2,
  "query": "test"
}

### Search for a tenant next cursor
POST http://localhost:8180/api/v1/tenants/search
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "realmId": "152ab2d6-a4aa-4053-a3a6-546ebdf083f6",
